  {
   "c": "忙",
   "pinyin": "máng",
   "lectures": [
    "máng"
   ],
   "fr": "occupé, s'affairer",
   "en": "busy, to bustle about",
   "parts": [
    "忄",
    "亡"
   ],
   "nouveau": [
    1
   ],
   "sources": [
    "cjk-decomp"
   ],
   "role": "forme",
   "roles": {
    "亡": "forme",
    "忄": "sens"
   },
   "origine_fr": "Pour s'en souvenir : 忄, le cœur, se tient à côté de 亡, perdre, disparaître. Quand on est trop occupé, on perd le fil de ce que l'on ressent. 亡 se lit wáng : il rime avec máng, sans en avoir l'initiale.",
   "origine_en": "To remember it: 忄, the heart, stands beside 亡, to lose, to vanish. When you are too busy, you lose track of what you feel. 亡 reads wáng: it rhymes with máng, without its initial.",
   "etiquette": "mnemotechnique",
   "memo_fr": null,
   "memo_en": null,
   "mots": [
    {
     "hanzi": "不忙",
     "pinyin": "bùmáng",
     "fr": "pas occupé ; rien ne presse",
     "en": "not busy; there's no hurry",
     "audio": null
    },
    {
     "hanzi": "忙活",
     "pinyin": "mánghuo",
     "fr": "s'affairer, être pris par une tâche",
     "en": "to bustle about, to be busy with something",
     "audio": null
    }
   ],
   "phrase": {
